# GNAT on CuBit (userspace/ports/gcc): the Ada compiler proper, gnat1
# (docs/self-hosting.md, "GCC and GNAT"), started by the gcc driver for
# Ada sources. Like cc1, its argv is open-ended, so it has no typed
# parameters and no file scopes of its own: it reads the sources and the
# run-time library's specifications (adainclude) in the places its
# launcher delegates (decision D2). What it writes to descriptors 1 and 2
# goes to its unix.stdout and unix.stderr outlets.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "org.gnu.gcc.gnat1"
  version => "15.3.0"
  requests => [(service "filesystem" "filesystem")]
  outlets => [
    (Outlet "unix.stdout" Element.Text pages => 4)
    (Outlet "unix.stderr" Element.Text pages => 4)]
  descriptors => [(Descriptor 1 "unix.stdout") (Descriptor 2 "unix.stderr")])
